From 0f9546c4eefbbf55dc9cc3851f8c263c0a804bb9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DoubleGate <parobek@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:06:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] [UPSTREAM] analysis: test harness for analyzer unit tests
 (synthetic vectors)

Shared `#[cfg(test)]` helpers in `analysis/test_util` so each analyzer's tests do
not re-roll raw GSMTAP payloads or re-implement the run-and-collect loop:

- `packet_time(secs)`: a fixed, deterministic base time + offset (no wall clock).
- `nas_plain(payload)`: build a plain (unciphered) LTE NAS `InformationElement`
  from a raw NAS payload.
- `collect_events(analyzer, &[(ie, ts)])`: run an analyzer over a sequence and
  collect every emitted `Event`, for a concise golden comparison.

The per-analyzer named vector builders (identity request, attach/auth reject with
cause, security-mode EIA0, SIB builders) grow here as each detector lands. The
capture scrubber (sanitizing a real QMDL for committed vectors) is deferred until
on-device captures exist.

Ref: Orbic-Rayhunter T-OR-051 (analyzer phase foundation).
Signed-off-by: DoubleGate <parobek@gmail.com>
---
 lib/src/analysis/mod.rs       |   2 +
 lib/src/analysis/test_util.rs | 113 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 115 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 lib/src/analysis/test_util.rs

diff --git a/lib/src/analysis/mod.rs b/lib/src/analysis/mod.rs
index b520c1f..9a5d10f 100644
--- a/lib/src/analysis/mod.rs
+++ b/lib/src/analysis/mod.rs
@@ -9,4 +9,6 @@ pub mod no_nas_messages;
 pub mod null_cipher;
 pub mod priority_2g_downgrade;
 pub mod test_analyzer;
